 "decisions": [
  "STM32F405RGT6: the reference MCU of Betaflight/INAV (168 MHz FPU, 3 SPI, 6 UART, USB FS); huge ecosystem",
  "Power: TPS5430 buck (5.5-36 V in, 3 A, 500 kHz) for 5 V, then AP2112K-3.3 LDO: low-noise 3.3 V for MCU + IMU",
  "IMU on its own ferrite-filtered 3.3 V branch and SPI1 at up to 10 MHz; baro on I2C1 (PB8/PB9) away from the buck",
  "4-layer stack (SIG / GND / PWR / SIG): solid ground under the MCU/IMU and short return paths for the 500 kHz buck"
 ],
